# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For practical examples of the directed execution model, see the [Directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) guide as well as the [tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) and [Qiskit addon documentation](/guides/addons) on [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr "Para ver ejemplos prácticos del modelo de ejecución dirigida, consulta la guía [Modelo de ejecución dirigida](/guides/directed-execution-model), así como los [tutoriales](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) y la [documentación de los addons de Qiskit](/guides/addons) en [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Conclusión {#conclusion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modern quantum workflows increasingly rely on a collection of complementary tools rather than a single execution primitive.\n"
msgstr "Los flujos de trabajo cuánticos modernos dependen cada vez más de un conjunto de herramientas complementarias en lugar de una única primitiva de ejecución.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These tools support every stage of the workflow:\n"
msgstr "Estas herramientas respaldan cada etapa del flujo de trabajo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problem mapping\n"
msgstr "Mapeo del problema\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
